---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Skill Foundry | Practical Skills Platform"
  description="Skill Foundry is a practical learning platform for building useful skills through clear resources, tutorials, and real-world workflows."
  canonical="https://hub.skillfoundry-web.workers.dev/about/"
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="about-container">
        <p class="about-eyebrow">ABOUT SKILL FOUNDRY</p>
        <h1 class="about-title">Learn by building.</h1>
        <p class="about-lead">Skill Foundry is a practical learning platform for building useful skills through clear resources, tutorials, and real-world workflows.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-body">
      <div class="about-container">
        <div class="about-content">
          <section class="about-section-block">
            <h2>What Skill Foundry is for</h2>
            <p>Modern tools and technology are moving quickly, and it can be difficult to know which workflows, techniques, and skills are actually worth learning. Skill Foundry focuses on turning useful knowledge into practical resources you can understand and use.</p>
            <p>Each resource is built around a real task or outcome — so you can discover an idea, understand how it works, follow the process, and apply it to your own project.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="about-section-block">
            <h2>What you’ll find here</h2>
            <p>Practical tutorials, step-by-step blueprints, and executable workflows covering AI, content creation, video editing, design, automation, productivity, and other digital skills.</p>
            <p>The goal is simple: give you something useful to learn, try, and build with.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="about-section-block about-section-last">
            <h2>Built to grow with you</h2>
            <p>Our current resource library is free to access. Individual resources may recommend third-party tools with their own independent pricing. As new tools, workflows, and practical skills emerge, the library will continue to grow.</p>
            <div class="about-cta-wrap">
              <a class="about-cta-link" href="/resources/">
                Explore the resource library <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    min-height: 80vh;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about-container {
    width: min(740px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  /* 1. Hero Section */
  .about-hero {
    padding: clamp(48px, 6vw, 72px) 0 clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 36px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #1E293B);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 75% 20%, rgba(var(--accent-rgb, 245, 158, 11), 0.08), transparent 38%);
  }

  .about-eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    color: var(--accent, #F59E0B);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .about-title {
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    color: #F8FAFC;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5.5vw, 54px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .about-lead {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 680px;
    color: #94A3B8;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2.2vw, 18px);
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  /* 2. Body Narrative Section */
  .about-body {
    padding: 40px 0 64px;
  }

  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 34px;
  }

  .about-section-block h2 {
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    color: #F8FAFC;
    font-size: clamp(21px, 3.2vw, 26px);
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1.22;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .about-section-block p {
    margin: 0 0 14px 0;
    color: #CBD5E1;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.68;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .about-section-block p:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-cta-wrap {
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .about-cta-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    color: var(--accent, #F59E0B);
    font-size: 15.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .about-cta-link .arrow {
    display: inline-block;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .about-cta-link:hover {
    color: #FBBF24;
  }

  .about-cta-link:hover .arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }

  /* Light Theme Overrides */
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .about-hero,
  :global(html.light-theme) .about-hero {
    border-bottom-color: #E2E8F0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 75% 20%, rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.06), transparent 38%);
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .about-title,
  :global(html.light-theme) .about-title {
    color: #0F172A;
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .about-lead,
  :global(html.light-theme) .about-lead {
    color: #475569;
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .about-section-block h2,
  :global(html.light-theme) .about-section-block h2 {
    color: #0F172A;
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .about-section-block p,
  :global(html.light-theme) .about-section-block p {
    color: #334155;
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .about-eyebrow,
  :global(html.light-theme) .about-eyebrow {
    color: #D97706;
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .about-cta-link,
  :global(html.light-theme) .about-cta-link {
    color: #D97706;
  }

  /* Mobile Responsive Rhythm */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-container {
      width: min(740px, calc(100% - 32px));
    }

    .about-hero {
      padding: 40px 0 24px;
    }

    .about-body {
      padding: 28px 0 48px;
    }

    .about-content {
      gap: 26px;
    }

    .about-title {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .about-section-block h2 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .about-section-block p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .about-cta-wrap {
      margin-top: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>
